WEBVTT

00:03.317 --> 00:06.967
<b>When you level up too high and start trampling over monsters,</b>

00:06.967 --> 00:10.297
<b>you get the feeling you've lost something important.</b>

00:16.227 --> 00:19.267
<b>Akiha-sama!</b>

00:20.907 --> 00:21.987
<b>Nee-san.</b>

00:21.987 --> 00:23.147
<b>Hisui-chan!</b>

00:23.147 --> 00:26.007
<b>Everyone watching right now is dumbstruck.</b>

00:26.007 --> 00:27.897
<b>At least introduce yourself.</b>

00:27.897 --> 00:29.037
<b>Oh, hello.</b>

00:29.037 --> 00:30.647
<b>I'm everyone's Kohaku-chan!</b>

00:30.647 --> 00:34.467
<b>No, shouldn't you start by explaining what this is?</b>

00:34.467 --> 00:36.137
<b>Oh, from there?</b>

00:36.137 --> 00:39.287
<b>But I need to see Akiha-sama as soon as possible.</b>

00:39.287 --> 00:41.957
<b>But, Nee-san, the corridor up ahead...</b>

00:41.957 --> 00:43.407
<b>...is under construction.</b>

