01:04.437 --> 01:05.397
<b>cannot...</b>

01:05.397 --> 01:07.357
<b>lose!</b>

01:13.127 --> 01:16.347
<b>Akiha-sama, Koha-Ace got animated!</b>

01:16.347 --> 01:17.867
<b>The lead-up's way too long!</b>

01:17.867 --> 01:20.267
<b>You thought it'd be about the Tsukihime remake?</b>

01:20.267 --> 01:22.857
<b>What a shame! It's about Koha-Ace!</b>

01:22.857 --> 01:24.877
<b>It really <i>is </i></b><b>a shame!</b>

01:24.877 --> 01:28.607
<b>This wouldn't have happened if Kinoko had worked harder.</b>

01:28.607 --> 01:30.687
<b>Was saying that really okay?</b>

01:31.257 --> 01:34.507
<b>And so, Koha-Ace is about to start!</b>

01:34.507 --> 01:35.827
<b>We're doing this?</b>

01:35.827 --> 01:37.467
<b>That's what we intended, but...</b>

01:37.467 --> 01:38.657
<b>What's wrong?</b>

01:39.217 --> 01:42.247
<b>We blew our budget on the action scene just now.</b>

01:42.247 --> 01:44.437
<b>How stupid are you?!</b>

01:44.437 --> 01:49.397
<b>We hired Saber-san for publicity reasons,
but her performance fee is really expensive.</b>

01:49.717 --> 01:51.237
<b>Sorry I'm so popular.</b>

01:51.237 --> 01:53.367
<b>What'd you expect from our company's cash cow?</b>

01:54.107 --> 01:57.007
<b>Coming up next is Carnival Phantasm!</b>

01:57.007 --> 02:00.527
<b>I personally don't like Neko-Arc very much so I'll stay out of this.</b>

02:00.527 --> 02:03.107
<b>I'll leave it in her hands!</b>

02:03.447 --> 02:05.917
<b>That was totally unnecessary!</b>

02:07.987 --> 02:12.617
<b>I didn't think they'd make an anime with characters even more half-assed than us.</b>

02:12.617 --> 02:15.727
<b>Type-Moon is messing around too much.</b>

02:20.877 --> 02:22.717
<b>Hibiki-chan, Chikagi-chan.</b>

02:22.717 --> 02:24.137
<b>We're counting on you both again today.</b>

02:24.137 --> 02:25.707
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

02:26.247 --> 02:28.357
<b>Ooh, HibiChika!</b>

02:28.357 --> 02:32.607
<b>A-Ahnenerbe's master of cleaning up: Katsuragi Chikagi-chan!</b>

