05:59.287 --> 06:01.387
<b>Chika-chan isn't the culprit!</b>

06:01.387 --> 06:02.557
<b>Obviously not!</b>

06:02.557 --> 06:04.027
<b>Stop making me look suspicious!</b>

06:06.937 --> 06:08.547
<b>Keep this a secret.</b>

06:08.547 --> 06:11.197
<b>Wh-What do you...</b>

06:11.437 --> 06:14.767
<b>You shouldn't dig too deep into the affairs of the underworld.</b>

06:20.227 --> 06:22.747
<b>Not a word to anybody, please.</b>

