<b>Wait!</b>

06:25.467 --> 06:26.387
<b>Cellphone-san!</b>

06:26.387 --> 06:27.327
<b>You monster!</b>

06:27.327 --> 06:28.767
<b>Somebody just died here!</b>

06:28.767 --> 06:31.137
<b>Money can't solve this!</b>

06:31.137 --> 06:33.587
<b>It's always money, money, money...</b>

06:34.057 --> 06:35.517
<b>and money!</b>

06:38.667 --> 06:40.527
<b>The world runs on money.</b>

06:41.967 --> 06:44.037
<b>Don't just give in to her!</b>

06:45.097 --> 06:49.087
<b>The underworld really is something to be feared, though.</b>

06:49.087 --> 06:51.557
<b>Chika-chan, should we really take all this money?</b>

