06:57.497 --> 06:59.627
<b>You seem happy, Greenfreak.</b>

06:57.497 --> 06:59.627
<b>TL Note: Greenfreak is a (very ugly) monster in Astro Fighter Sunred.</b>

06:59.627 --> 07:00.607
<b>Shut up or I'll snap you.</b>

07:00.607 --> 07:02.637
<b>Chika-chan! Chika-chan!</b>

07:02.637 --> 07:03.567
<b>What's up?</b>

07:03.567 --> 07:04.507
<b>Did you get an order-</b>

07:04.507 --> 07:05.497
<b>I can't believe it!</b>

07:05.497 --> 07:08.107
<b>I've seen those people before!</b>

07:10.407 --> 07:11.187
<b>Oh.</b>

07:11.187 --> 07:12.057
<b>Right? Right?</b>

07:13.237 --> 07:15.887
<b>I think they used to be on TV a while ago.</b>

07:15.887 --> 07:17.227
<b>I know, right?</b>

07:17.227 --> 07:19.087
<b>They're one-hit comedians.</b>

07:19.087 --> 07:22.267
<b>Oh right, they're the Afterschool Something-or-other Alliance.</b>

07:22.267 --> 07:23.747
<b>Huh?</b>

07:27.747 --> 07:28.767
<b>What is it?</b>

07:28.767 --> 07:31.017
<b>We've already placed our order.</b>

07:31.017 --> 07:32.427
<b>Um...</b>

07:32.427 --> 07:33.817
<b>Uh...</b>

07:35.607 --> 07:37.997
<b>Like this, right?</b>

07:39.747 --> 07:41.487
<b>Not really...</b>

07:41.487 --> 07:44.717
<b>But I guess that stage of my life did exist.</b>

07:44.717 --> 07:46.677
<b>So I was right!</b>

07:46.677 --> 07:48.017
<b>I'm so touched!</b>

07:48.017 --> 07:50.177
<b>I didn't think I'd meet you here!</b>

07:50.927 --> 07:52.367
<b>What should I do?</b>

07:51.427 --> 07:52.367
<b>Look!</b>

07:52.367 --> 07:54.737
<b>We still have fans!</b>

07:54.737 --> 07:57.397
<b>We were on the right course!</b>

07:57.397 --> 07:59.407
<b>Who needs jokes these days?</b>

07:59.407 --> 08:01.577
<b>It was a miscalculation.</b>

08:01.577 --> 08:03.277
<b>But you guys pulled me in!</b>

08:03.277 --> 08:05.797
<b>I loved you guys!</b>

08:05.797 --> 08:08.627
<b>That's right, you were called the... the...</b>

08:08.627 --> 08:12.627
<b>Ahh, I'm so close to remembering it!</b>

08:12.627 --> 08:14.197
<b>Don't give up!</b>

08:14.487 --> 08:17.037
<b>Warble! Wriggly Republic!</b>

08:17.037 --> 08:18.917
<b>That's totally wrong!</b>

08:18.917 --> 08:20.007
<b>I like that name.</b>

08:20.007 --> 08:21.167
<b>You do?!</b>

08:21.167 --> 08:22.647
<b>It seems to fit my calculations.</b>

08:22.647 --> 08:23.997
<b>It does?</b>

08:25.307 --> 08:28.447
<b>That trio will probably mess up their next act as well.</b>

