<b>Shirou?</b>

14:25.787 --> 14:30.407
<b>O-Oh, I was just wondering if this is for the best.</b>

14:30.407 --> 14:32.737
<b>Specifically?</b>

14:32.737 --> 14:34.977
<b>The fact that I chose you.</b>

14:34.977 --> 14:38.167
<b>Wh-Why would you think about it now?</b>

14:50.047 --> 14:51.887
<b>I'll get it.</b>

