<b>Shirou-kun, how's it been so far?</b>

15:01.977 --> 15:03.457
<b>What do you mean?</b>

15:03.457 --> 15:08.837
<b>Has anything strange happened since that fateful day?</b>

15:08.837 --> 15:11.777
<b>Nothing worth mentioning.</b>

15:11.777 --> 15:13.787
<b>That's good, then.</b>

15:13.787 --> 15:16.427
<b>Did you run into some sort of trouble?</b>

15:16.427 --> 15:18.657
<b>No, I didn't.</b>

15:20.887 --> 15:23.047
<b>You're just nervous.</b>

15:23.047 --> 15:26.537
<b>I mean, your girlfriend is a True Ancestor.</b>

15:26.537 --> 15:28.397
<b>Though it's not like I can relate.</b>

15:28.397 --> 15:30.527
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

15:30.527 --> 15:32.887
<b>I guess I'm just nervous.</b>

15:32.887 --> 15:34.407
<b>Hang in there.</b>

15:34.407 --> 15:37.307
<b>You may be different beings, but I'm sure things will go well.</b>

15:37.307 --> 15:39.767
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

