20:26.457 --> 20:29.307
<b>Truth is, I was five-timing...</b>

20:29.307 --> 20:30.127
<b>Five-timing?</b>

20:30.127 --> 20:33.037
<b>No, six... or seven...</b>

20:33.827 --> 20:36.467
<b>Shirou, you too?</b>

20:36.857 --> 20:38.207
<b>I...</b>

20:38.207 --> 20:41.327
<b>I just wanted to make everyone happy!</b>

20:41.887 --> 20:46.187
<b>Such self-centered happiness obviously doesn't exist!</b>

20:46.637 --> 20:49.167
<b>I don't care much for the little details...</b>

20:49.167 --> 20:52.707
<b>but I hope the two of you are ready for this.</b>

20:58.217 --> 21:01.377
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

21:01.377 --> 21:03.287
<b>Feel free to do whatever you want with me!</b>

21:03.287 --> 21:05.347
<b>I couldn't make everyone happy!</b>

21:05.347 --> 21:07.347
<b>It's my fault!</b>

21:12.167 --> 21:13.527
<b>Do you mean...</b>

21:13.527 --> 21:15.607
<b>...what you said?</b>

21:16.427 --> 21:18.207
<b>Akiha! Senpai!</b>

21:18.207 --> 21:20.067
<b>Everyone! Why?</b>

21:20.307 --> 21:24.527
<b>You just needed to admit your mistake.</b>

21:24.527 --> 21:26.617
<b>Make sure you repent.</b>

21:26.617 --> 21:30.687
<b>It's not like I was angry all the time or something.</b>

21:30.687 --> 21:31.957
<b>How stupid are you?</b>

21:31.957 --> 21:35.957
<b>Well, I don't intend to reproach you any further.</b>

21:35.957 --> 21:38.397
<b>My apologies, Shiki-sama.</b>

21:39.187 --> 21:41.467
<b>Looks like this practical joke went too far.</b>

21:41.467 --> 21:44.217
<b>Senpai, aren't you glad?</b>

21:45.267 --> 21:46.647
<b>Everyone!</b>

21:46.647 --> 21:50.387
<b>Oh? That's good enough for you all?</b>

21:50.387 --> 21:52.517
<b>Simply repenting will do?</b>

21:52.517 --> 21:55.107
<b>Humans sure are hard to understand.</b>

21:55.107 --> 21:57.367
<b>Saber, are you fine with this?</b>

21:58.067 --> 22:00.037
<b>Fix your faults.</b>

22:00.487 --> 22:02.337
<b>That's exactly it, Shirou.</b>

22:02.337 --> 22:04.487
<b>Redo everything from the beginning.</b>

22:04.487 --> 22:09.747
<b>Go from being a pathetic protagonist to being a brilliant and honest man!</b>

22:13.297 --> 22:15.807
<b>Thank you, everyone!</b>

22:18.447 --> 22:19.777
<b>Shirou-kun!</b>

22:21.367 --> 22:23.007
<b>Shiki-san!</b>

22:25.997 --> 22:29.937
<b>Our adolescence has only just begun!</b>

22:30.597 --> 22:32.637
<b>Truly adolescence.</b>

22:32.637 --> 22:34.517
<b>It really is adolescence.</b>

22:35.967 --> 22:37.787
<b>You think so?</b>

22:45.807 --> 22:47.327
<b>I'm home.</b>

22:49.117 --> 22:50.327
<b>Huh?</b>

22:50.327 --> 22:52.617
<b>I'm digging in!</b>

22:54.607 --> 22:55.817
<b>Huh?</b>

22:58.687 --> 23:00.667
<b>Huh?</b>

23:02.667 --> 23:06.607
<b>I'm so sick of dates!</b>

23:10.237 --> 23:12.907
<b>What a tragic incident.</b>

23:12.907 --> 23:14.067
<b>How stupid are you?</b>

23:14.067 --> 23:19.077
<b>Anyway, Fate aside, the Tsukihime cast is always like that.</b>

23:19.077 --> 23:22.067
<b>Are our everyday lives really <i>that</i> </b><b>tense?</b>

23:22.067 --> 23:27.607
<b>Well, at any rate, that was some enjoyable
Carnival Phantasm anime with Hibiki and Chikagi!</b>

23:27.607 --> 23:30.387
<b>Yep, everything except for Koha-Ace was enjoyable.</b>

23:30.387 --> 23:31.867
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

23:31.867 --> 23:35.807
<b>As the first Type-Moon characters, we need to keep working hard!</b>

23:35.807 --> 23:39.307
<b>But the Tsukihime game is over ten years old.</b>

23:39.307 --> 23:43.237
<b>This wouldn't have happened if
Kinoko had made the remake earlier.</b>

23:43.237 --> 23:46.007
<b>Right, blame it all on Kinoko!</b>

23:46.007 --> 23:49.847
<b>So, how did you find the Koha-Ace anime, Rider-san?</b>

23:49.847 --> 23:51.617
<b>Rider's appearing too?</b>

23:51.617 --> 23:54.507
<b>What's with this ridiculous anime?</b>

23:54.507 --> 23:55.567
<b>Well, <i>sorry</i> </b><b>!</b>

23:55.567 --> 24:00.287
<b>This animation also features Rider-san, plus it leaves me feeling very satisfied!</b>

24:00.287 --> 24:03.167
<b>I'm sure you wanted something more properly done, right?</b>

24:03.167 --> 24:08.607
<b>If Saber's meal costs hadn't strained our production budget, I'm sure we could've done better.</b>

24:08.607 --> 24:09.977
<b>Spend the money wisely!</b>

24:10.447 --> 24:13.967
<b>If I had known that Saber-san would cost so much,</b>

24:13.967 --> 24:16.867
<b>I would've made the offer to Red Saber-san instead.</b>

24:16.867 --> 24:17.637
<b>Mmm!</b>

24:17.637 --> 24:19.957
<b>Leave everything to me!</b>

24:19.957 --> 24:21.917
<b>You got her to come anyway!</b>

24:21.917 --> 24:27.147
<b>It was a little ploy to get Red Saber-san animated before the other Sabers.</b>

24:27.147 --> 24:29.347
<b>It's the debut of the national tyrant!</b>

24:29.347 --> 24:31.537
<b>Blue is still working hard here!</b>

24:31.537 --> 24:34.067
<b>Didn't she appear in Carnival Phantasm though?</b>

24:34.067 --> 24:35.847
<b>Damn you, Kishi Seiji.</b>

24:35.847 --> 24:38.647
<b>Oh right, it's time for the ending theme!</b>

24:38.647 --> 24:39.667
<b>Let's run!</b>

24:39.667 --> 24:40.657
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

24:40.657 --> 24:41.937
<b>You didn't know?</b>

24:41.937 --> 24:45.227
<b>There's a jinx that says people run during the ED in good anime!</b>

24:45.227 --> 24:47.247
<b>What?!</b>

