25:03.487 --> 25:05.767
<b>Enough! I know already!</b>

25:05.767 --> 25:09.027
<b>And it's weird how the main character did everything!</b>

25:09.027 --> 25:11.197
<b>Don't worry, Akiha-sama.</b>

25:11.197 --> 25:15.517
<b>I actually had Moriyama Yuuji-san do all the action scenes!</b>

25:15.517 --> 25:17.887
<b>Moriyama, what on Earth were you thinking?!</b>

25:17.887 --> 25:20.507
<b>Sounds like a lot of resources got wasted.</b>

25:22.527 --> 25:25.307
<b>By the way, I'd like to ask something.</b>

25:25.307 --> 25:27.267
<b>Does my anime come after this?</b>

25:27.267 --> 25:30.107
<b>Sorry, but this is all the screentime Red gets.</b>

25:30.107 --> 25:31.157
<b>I see.</b>

25:31.157 --> 25:34.727
<b>Due to Fate/Zero, I am now a superior and popular Servant.</b>

25:34.727 --> 25:38.037
<b>A high-budget anime about Blue Saber's younger days must be coming up next.</b>

25:38.037 --> 25:39.107
<b>It isn't.</b>

25:39.107 --> 25:42.607
<b>Huh? Is this really all the screentime I'll get?</b>

25:42.607 --> 25:43.557
<b>Sorry!</b>

25:43.557 --> 25:46.707
<b>We were thinking about making this a Red Saber-Ace anime,</b>

25:46.707 --> 25:48.957
<b>but the higher-ups banned the idea.</b>

25:48.957 --> 25:52.747
<b>Then citizens expecting to see me in all my glory can only smile bitterly.</b>

25:52.747 --> 25:55.837
<b>Didn't those citizens exile you from your own country?</b>

25:55.837 --> 25:57.277
<b>Red's a riot!</b>

25:57.277 --> 25:58.927
<b>You're one to talk.</b>

25:58.927 --> 26:00.747
<b>Blue's old content anyway.</b>

26:00.747 --> 26:02.917
<b>Shut up, Red!</b>

26:02.917 --> 26:05.197
<b>And now, it pains me to say goodbye,</b>

26:05.197 --> 26:07.787
<b>but I'm sure we'll meet again someday!</b>

26:09.997 --> 26:11.647
<b>Sakura!</b>
